Spec: SpecDD References Search

Platform: IntelliJ Platform / Kotlin

Purpose:
  Expose SpecDD references to IntelliJ search, find usages, and code-side rename refactors.

Owns:
  ./SpecDDReferencesSearch.kt

Can modify:
  ./SpecDDReferencesSearch.kt

Can read:
  ./SpecDDPathReferenceProvider.kt
  /src/test/kotlin/ai/specdd/idea/references/SpecDDReferencesSearchBehaviorSpec.kt

Must:
  Implement IntelliJ `@ReferencesSearch` query execution for SpecDD references.
  Search SpecDD files by target name candidates supplied by IntelliJ target elements.
  Read IntelliJ PSI target names only inside a read action because find usages can run on pooled threads.
  Use the existing SpecDD path and symbol reference provider to produce references at text occurrences.
  Return only references that resolve to the searched target.
  Support code-side rename discovery for exact file path references.
  Support code-side rename discovery for explicit `@` symbol references.
  Keep symbol lookup language agnostic.
  Do not create references for plain, non-`@` symbols.
  Do not add structural diagnostics.

Must not:
  Resolve glob references for automatic rename.
  Depend on language-specific plugins.
